The time taken by electron to travel a distance 1 in that space

\begin{aligned}
t=\frac{1}{v} &=\frac{1}{\frac{\sigma}{\varepsilon_{0} B}} \\
&=\frac{\varepsilon_{0} l B}{\sigma}
\end{aligned}

